                  "children": [
                    " ",
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "lang-en"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        "Strategic Expansion"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "lang-mr-text deva"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        "विस्तार"
                      ]
                    },
                    " "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "h2",
                  "props": {},
                  "children": [
                    " ",
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "lang-en"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        "JINJI AND VELLORE"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "lang-mr-text deva"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        "जिंजी आणि वेल्लोर"
                      ]
                    },
                    " "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " In 1677, Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj embarked on his legendary southward campaign. Supported by a robust diplomatic background—including strategic understandings with the Qutb Shahi dynasty of Golconda—his forces marched deep into the Carnatic region. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " Accounts of the southern campaign connect Maratha expansion with ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "Jinji"
                      ]
                    },
                    " and ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "Vellore"
                      ]
                    },
                    ". The timing and terms of control differed by place and source; these strongholds later became important to Maratha power in the south. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " १६७७ मध्ये महाराजांनी दक्षिणेकडील मोहिमेला सुरुवात केली. गोवळकोंड्याच्या कुतुबशाहीशी मुत्सद्दी वाटाघाटी करून त्यांनी कर्नाटकात प्रवेश केला. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " या मोहिमेत त्यांनी ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "जिंजी"
                      ]
                    },
                    " आणि ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "वेल्लोर"
                      ]
                    },
                    " यांसारखे अभेद्य किल्ले जिंकले. स्वराज्याच्या संरक्षणासाठी जिंजीचा प्रदेश त्यांनी आपल्या ताब्यात ठेवला. "
                  ]
                },
                " "
              ]
            },
            " "
          ]
        },
        " ",
        " ",
        {
          "tag": "section",
          "props": {
            "className": "band band--campaign"
          },
          "children": [
            " ",
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "props": {
                "className": "band__panel band__panel--ivory"
              },
              "children": [
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "plaque"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " ",
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "lang-en"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        "Diplomacy"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "lang-mr-text deva"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        "मुत्सद्देगिरी"
                      ]
                    },
                    " "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "h2",
                  "props": {},
                  "children": [
                    " ",
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "lang-en"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        "THE ARRANGEMENT WITH VYANKOJI"
                      ]
                    },
                    " ",
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "lang-mr-text deva"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        "व्यंकोजी राजांसोबतची वाटाघाटी"
                      ]
                    },
                    " "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " A key aspect of the southern campaign involved his step-brother, Vyankoji (Ekoji) Bhosale, who ruled Thanjavur. Rather than engaging in a protracted civil war, Shivaji Maharaj executed a masterful diplomatic and military maneuver. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " Accounts describe negotiations and conflict with Vyankoji over southern territories. The boundaries and terms of the settlement require comparison of dated records; a precise river-line division is not established here. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " या मोहिमेचा एक महत्त्वाचा भाग म्हणजे त्यांचे सावत्र भाऊ व्यंकोजीराजे भोसले यांच्यासोबतचा समझोता. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " दक्षिणेतील प्रदेशांबाबत व्यंकोजी राजांशी वाटाघाटी आणि संघर्ष झाल्याची वर्णने आहेत. समझोत्याच्या नेमक्या सीमा व अटींसाठी दिनांकित साधनांची तुलना आवश्यक आहे. "
                  ]
                },
                " "
              ]
            },
